[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584325\">1092B68</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584328\">1092C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584331\">1092D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584321\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584194\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584583\">2110A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584196\">1032B44</a></p><p>1. Prise up and remove the crankshaft front cover sealing ring</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The sealing ring is destroyed\nwhen it is removed and must therefore always be changed.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2020898.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Use the appropriate tool to fit a new oil sealing ring to the\ncrankshaft front cover.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.990.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2020899.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2584196\">1032B44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584583\">2110A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584194\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584321\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584331\">1092D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584328\">1092C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584325\">1092B68</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]